"These printers only support 2.4 GHz (802.11 b/g/n). Your router must broadcast this band. A shared name for 2.4 and 5 GHz is usually fine." = "这些打印机仅支持 2.4 GHz（802.11 b/g/n）。您的路由器必须广播此频段。2.4 和 5 GHz 使用相同名称通常没有问题。";
"WPA2 instead of WPA3-only" = "使用 WPA2 而非仅 WPA3";
"The printer does not support WPA3. Set the router to “WPA2‑Personal (AES)” or the mixed “WPA2/WPA3” mode." = "打印机不支持 WPA3。请将路由器设置为“WPA2‑Personal（AES）”或混合“WPA2/WPA3”模式。";
"Fixed channel 1, 6 or 11" = "固定信道 1、6 或 11";
"Automatic channel switching on the router can disconnect the printer. A fixed channel and 20 MHz width on 2.4 GHz help stability." = "路由器的自动信道切换可能会导致打印机断开连接。在 2.4 GHz 上使用固定信道和 20 MHz 带宽有助于提高稳定性。";
"Reserve the IP address" = "保留 IP 地址";
"Give the printer a fixed address on your router (DHCP reservation by MAC). Your Mac will always find it in the same place." = "在路由器上为打印机分配固定地址（按 MAC 进行 DHCP 保留）。这样您的 Mac 总能在同一位置找到它。";
"Deep sleep" = "深度睡眠";
"If the printer does not respond after waking up, adjust Sleep Time and Auto Power Off in the printer’s web interface (General › Sleep Time)." = "如果打印机唤醒后无响应，请在打印机的 Web 界面（General › Sleep Time）中调整睡眠时间和自动关机。";
"Turn off Wi‑Fi Direct" = "关闭 Wi‑Fi Direct";
"If you don’t use Wi‑Fi Direct, turn it off – the printer then doesn’t have to serve two wireless links at once." = "如果不使用 Wi‑Fi Direct，请将其关闭——这样打印机就不必同时维持两个无线连接。";
"AirPrint instead of old drivers" = "使用 AirPrint 代替旧驱动程序";
"Add the printer in macOS via AirPrint (Settings › Printers & Scanners). No Brother driver is needed." = "在 macOS 中通过 AirPrint 添加打印机（“系统设置 › 打印机与扫描仪”）。无需 Brother 驱动程序。";
"Placement" = "摆放位置";
"Metal cabinets, microwaves and walls weaken the signal. Your network should show at least 2 bars in the network scan." = "金属柜、微波炉和墙壁会削弱信号。在网络扫描中，您的网络应至少显示 2 格信号。";
"What helps most to keep the printer on Wi‑Fi." = "让打印机保持 Wi‑Fi 连接的最有效方法。";
"Connect the printer to your network – more reliably than the original wizard." = "将打印机连接到您的网络——比原版向导更可靠。";
"Could not send the settings" = "无法发送设置";
"Connect the printer to “%@”?" = "要将打印机连接到“%@”吗？";
"Send Settings" = "发送设置";
"The printer leaves its current network and tries to join the new one. Verification takes up to 3 minutes – don’t turn it off meanwhile." = "打印机将离开当前网络并尝试加入新网络。验证最多需要 3 分钟——在此期间请勿关机。";
"Available networks" = "可用网络";
"Scan for Networks" = "扫描网络";
"Scan Again" = "重新扫描";
"The printer found no networks. It only supports 2.4 GHz – check that your router broadcasts it." = "打印机未找到任何网络。它仅支持 2.4 GHz——请检查路由器是否广播该频段。";
"Raw printer response" = "打印机原始响应";
"Let the printer scan for nearby networks. You’ll see exactly what its antenna sees, including signal strength." = "让打印机扫描附近的网络。您将看到其天线所接收到的全部内容，包括信号强度。";
"“%@” uses WPA‑Enterprise, which this app cannot configure yet. Use the printer’s web interface." = "“%@”使用 WPA‑Enterprise，本应用暂时无法配置。请使用打印机的 Web 界面。";
